<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">For
purposes of determining non-GAAP adjusted earnings per share, the Company used the number of common shares outstanding at the end of
December 31, 2025 and 2024. Non-GAAP adjusted earnings per share does not take into account dividends on the Preferred Stock. No tax
effect has been provided in computing non-GAAP adjusted earnings per share as the Company has sufficient carry forward net operating
losses to offset the applicable income taxes.</span></p>

