preliminary purchase price allocation of the MAP App acquisition is summarized as follows:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8B3_zlcQajts8MO8" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF ALLOCATION OF PURCHASE PRICE</span></span></span></p>

