</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AE_zqCcoFr1Fl5a" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2025 and 2024, there was approximately $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized_iI_c20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--PreferredStockMember_zPQFmJ5Kt553" title="Share-based payment arrangement, nonvested award, cost not yet recognized, amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember" id="Fact001807" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">271,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized_iI_c20241231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--PreferredStockMember_zlcvbqgIRfi6" title="Share-based payment arrangement, nonvested award, cost not yet recognized, amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember" id="Fact001809" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">416,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, of total unrecognized compensation cost related
to the common stock RSUs classified as equity that will be expensed through 2027. As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, there were <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized_iI_do_c20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--PreferredStockMember_zCEK1VX5Z3C2" title="Sharebased compensation nonvested awards total compensation cost not yet recognized"><span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized_iI_do_c20241231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--PreferredStockMember_zZRGNKtySjVj" title="Sharebased compensation nonvested awards total compensation cost not yet recognized"><ix:nonFraction name="CCLD:ShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember" id="Fact001811" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="CCLD:ShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember" id="Fact001813" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> unrecognized
compensation costs related to the Series A and Series B Preferred Stock RSUs.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Of
the total outstanding and unvested common stock RSUs at December 31, 2025 and 2024, all of <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsNonvestedNumberOfShares_iI_c20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--PreferredStockMember_zSHADuIl4PHb" title="Unvested stock option award, equity"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsNonvestedNumberOfShares" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember" id="Fact001815" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">161,400</ix:nonFraction></span> and <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsNonvestedNumberOfShares_iI_c20241231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--PreferredStockMember_zVEfG3s5Ej45" title="Unvested stock option award, equity"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsNonvestedNumberOfShares" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember" id="Fact001817" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">242,500</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, are classified
as equity. For both 2025 and 2024, all of the Series B Preferred Stock RSUs are classified as equity.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

